-
If you check
user.role
everywhere: ImplementhasPermission(resource, action)
- If you write snapshot tests: Write one integration test that proves behavior
-
If you have logic in
useEffect
: Extract it to a service file
You don't need to refactor everything. Start with one new feature. See how it feels.
